ng his conquests, the planet, which seemed ordinary at first, always yields minute details that pique the detective's interest.<br><br>The secrets that lie behind it will be exposed with Daigneux and the detective's arrival...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2291680/extras/a8b08679c4153fd7a356a0c33193a06c.webp?t=1752806051\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2291680/extras/9a628a5a8d3951bb26b0b296013ffb10.poster.avif?t=1752806051\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2291680/extras/9a628a5a8d3951bb26b0b296013ffb10.webm?t=1752806051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2291680/extras/9a628a5a8d3951bb26b0b296013ffb10.mp4?t=1752806051\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2291680/extras/cc79d98c5567d0f4152f8eb60ef6c282.avif?t=1752806051\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2291680/extras/a400d7fbda05728c2ae8fed1046085b5.avif?t=1752806051\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2291680/extras/8cdc66f809a4d1939aa9b6a11d8ba1bf.poster.avif?t=1752806051\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2291680/extras/8cdc66f809a4d1939aa9b6a11d8ba1bf.webm?t=1752806051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2291680/extras/8cdc66f809a4d1939aa9b6a11d8ba1bf.mp4?t=1752